      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis a relief that we were able to address his\r\ndeformed existence without the\r\ncitizenry taking notice.",
        "Jp" : "彼の異形の存在を民に気付かれることもなく\r\n対処できたことに、胸を撫で下ろしております"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 726690,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When word reached us of Prince Nedo's safety, and\r\nthe rumors of the Arisen from a foreign land —\r\nfor us, such tidings was greatly heartening, yet\r\n'twas naught but a faint hope.",
        "Jp" : "ネド王子のご無事、そして異国の覚者様の\r\nお噂を聞いたとき――我々にとってその話は\r\n非常に喜ばしく、けれども\r\nかすかな希望でしかありませんでした"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 726691,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Howbeit, Ser Arisen's exploits thus far — 'tis a\r\nfeeling that the complete restoration of House\r\nAcre has turned to conviction.",
        "Jp" : "しかし、ここまでの覚者様のご活躍――\r\n完全なるアッカ―王家の再興が\r\n確信に変わる思いです"
      },
